{"id": "53963", "title": "Viola教育论", "author": "miss question", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 20, "available": 12, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/53/53963.htm", "intro": "Viola只是遵从她那个好像有占卜能力的母亲的遗言，找到了Tom，并照她所说的收养他，就这样展开了两人一蛇的生活。 Tom会进Hogwarts，但说真的，我只是想写关于一个女人收养Tom的故事，那个女人的老公会是谁才不是我关心的呢！好吧，Viola的另一半我已经决定是个自创的了。 我真的真的不会写文案 orz JEWEL-滨崎あゆみ  (其实我只是觉得文案空空的又懒得想，所以试着放音乐来撑场面哈哈哈哈哈)", "base": "files/article/html/53/53963", "chapters": [{"title": "Chapter 1", "file": "7530746.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 2", "file": "7530748.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 3", "file": "7530750.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 4", "file": "7530752.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 5", "file": "7530753.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 6", "file": "7530755.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 7", "file": "7530759.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 8", "file": "7530760.html", "available": false}, {"title": "Chapter 9", "file": "7530762.html", "available": true}, {"title": "Chapter 10", "file": "7530764.html", "available": true}, {"title": "Chapter 11", "file": "7530766.html", "available": true}, {"title": "Chapter 12", "file": "7530767.html", "available": true}, {"title": "Chapter 13", "file": "7530769.html", "available": true}, {"title": "Chapter 14", "file": "7530770.html", "available": true}, {"title": "Chapter 15", "file": "7530774.html", "available": true}, {"title": "Chapter 16", "file": "7530775.html", "available": true}, {"title": "无责任番外 被Merlin所眷顾的人", "file": "7530776.html", "available": true}, {"title": "Chapter 17", "file": "7530778.html", "available": true}, {"title": "Chapter 18", "file": "7530780.html", "available": true}, {"title": "Chapter 19", "file": "7530782.html", "available": true}]}